;
; How the Banker files an entry of a folder in the Hoard, in MYRA: its
; position, size in bytes and modification time (Unix seconds). The Banker
; asks whether the numbers fit before it shows them.
^ZXHOARD(folder:i9, seq:i9) = size:i18! ^ mtime:i12!
